     </table><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_029cd13b-2b1d-42b3-bc86-d70df3855649" contextRef="C_b5e50117-c74d-4838-9127-2d24e8eeca4c" name="ecd:NamedExecutiveOfficersFnTextBlock" escape="true"><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:6.667%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:6.667%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(1)</span><div style="width:100%;display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">dollar amounts reported are the total compensation reported to </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_dc42db5a-494d-4c07-b2c2-70b0087663c7" contextRef="C_f2cace77-4d33-4a38-b979-89c056381ccc" name="ecd:PeoName"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Ms. Newquist</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> (&#8220;CEO #1&#8221;) for each fiscal year in the &#8220;Total&#8221; column of the Summary Compensation Table. Ms. Newquist became our Chief Executive Officer on September 6, 2024</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:6.667%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:6.667%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(2)</span><div style="width:100%;display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">dollar amounts reported are the total compensation reported to </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_e7b01f7d-e222-46eb-afd5-521cc9395c7a" contextRef="C_a1ff1600-b76e-4ec9-a3ba-83349294ce1f" name="ecd:PeoName"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_f4a99b5a-e933-4577-b425-f37d89c74222" contextRef="C_c1236ba8-857b-4b27-b916-d1b43e55db1d" name="ecd:PeoName"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_6c4e2c5f-bf44-4b77-809f-272cd9736292" contextRef="C_0961c945-aa6c-4e98-9ff4-f43f2dc8ab2b" name="ecd:PeoName"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Mr. Humphreys</span></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> (&#8220;CEO #2&#8221;) for each fiscal year in the &#8220;Total&#8221; column of the Summary Compensation Table. Mr. Humphreys served as our Chief Executive Officer from September 2014 until September 6, 2024</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></div></div></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_a42a0290-50e7-4f1b-81f9-0d328a74a404" contextRef="C_b5e50117-c74d-4838-9127-2d24e8eeca4c" name="ecd:AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock" escape="true"><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:6.667%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:6.667%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(3)</span><div style="width:100%;display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The following represents the adjustments made to the Summary Compensation Table totals for our CEO #1 to derive the compensation actually paid to our CEO #1.</span></div></div>
